<title>UK: GPT wins BT 100 mln stg UK contract.</title>
<headline>GPT wins BT 100 mln stg UK contract.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>British-based telecoms manufacturer GPT said on Tuesday it had won a service contract worth over 100 million stg from British Telecommunications Plc to support a UK Ministry of Defence network.</p>
<p>GPT is owned by Britain's General Electric Co Plc and Germany's Siemens AG.</p>
